zxcvbn-c dictionary generator and inputs

Source: tsyrogit/zxcvbn-c, tag v2.5 (commit f3f2d71)
https://github.com/tsyrogit/zxcvbn-c/tree/v2.5

The files dict-generate.cpp and words-*.txt are copied from that release.
The generated dict-src.h is intentionally produced in Cargo's OUT_DIR during
build. The existing generated header was byte-for-byte identical to output
from this generator and these six word lists before they were vendored.

The upstream project and these files are licensed under the MIT License;
see LICENSE.txt in the upstream release. The generator has a local portability
fix: it includes <cstdint> explicitly, as required for uint64_t on current
compilers.
